{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.10.460","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.10.460","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.460","content_hash":"99c7c0370e784a6492f1903aad68d994d5c58ace29ec007e2220500fca537eec","heading":"Damage to fire hydrant.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.460:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.460","text":"(a) Any person who damages or impairs the operation of a fire hydrant shall immediately notify the Water Division.\n(b) Each owner of a private fire hydrant shall notify both the Fire Chief and the Utilities Director if the owner has knowledge that a private water hydrant has been damaged or is inoperable. (Ord. 20089 § 23, 10-17-17.)\nCross References: Fire Department, TMC 2.20.030 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"1afa6ab6-85a8-5b3a-bef6-6617133e62e2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.460","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.460","content_hash":"324a72522f4826e2bf7c81af91cc0f3c7b55cb9c0066995426366cadc409c2ad","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.460:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.460:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.460","text":"(a) Any person who damages or impairs the operation of a fire hydrant shall immediately notify the Water Division.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4c6cc9f6-1186-51bc-8a4c-c8fc07ac9f3a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.460","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.460","content_hash":"f9f7de78e84b99abd01277fa9